      "description": "Flexible title with four fixed status cells; below 64 columns a compact S J D P icon trail preserves the title.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-inbox-row\" tabindex=\"0\"><span>Leaderboard MVP</span><span data-short=\"✓\">✓ done</span><span data-short=\"→\">→ ready</span><span data-short=\"○\">○ locked</span><span data-short=\"○\">○ locked</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-inbox-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(4,8ch);gap:2ch;overflow:hidden;font:600 16px \"JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono\",monospace;color:#89b4fa;background:transparent}.ds-inbox-row span{overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-inbox-row:hover,.ds-inbox-row:focus-visible{background:#94e2d5;color:#45475a;font-weight:700;outline:none}@media(max-width:64ch){.ds-inbox-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(4,1ch);gap:1ch}.ds-inbox-row span:not(:first-child){font-size:0}.ds-inbox-row span:not(:first-child)::after{content:attr(data-short);font-size:16px}}"
